<title>USA: Sumter Cty, S.C., won by First Union.</title>
<headline>Sumter Cty, S.C., won by First Union.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Union Capital Markets, Inc. said it won $1.150 million of Sumter Cty, S.C., general obligation bonds, Series 1997 B, with a net interest cost of 4.54 percent.</p>
</text>
